7. Hence, the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is partly allowed;
ii) The total compensation awarded by the Tribunal is modified and enhanced to Rs.3,33,372/- as against Rs.1,90,000/- which shall carry interest at the rate of 6% per annum on the enhanced compensation amount from the date of the claim petition till its realization.
iii) Respondent No.2 is directed to pay the petitioner the enhanced compensation of Rs.1,43,372/- over and above what has been awarded by the Tribunal along with 6%
interest per annum from the date of claim petition till the date of realization within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this order;
iv) Draw modified award accordingly;
